{"last_link_id": 116, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [94], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [120, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seconds"}, "name": "seconds", "link": 95, "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptyYuE2LatentAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [238.4100799560547, 90], "pos": [4434.14599609375, -67.30807495117188], "id": 51, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"seconds": true, "batch_size": true}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyYuE2LatentAudio"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [98], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [230, 60], "pos": [5097.9716796875, -204.5913848876953], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 96, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 97, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "VAEDecodeAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudio"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# YuE2: Text to Music\n\nYuE2 is a music generation model that creates complete songs with vocals and instrumental accompaniment from a **music style** and **lyrics**.\n\nWith ABC Planning enabled, YuE2 first creates an editable symbolic music plan (melody and optionally chords), then generates the final audio from that plan.\n\n## Model Link\n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2/resolve/main/checkpoints/yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   └── 📂 checkpoints/\n│       └── yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n```\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Write a description of the music you want in **Style**.\n2. Enter your song lyrics in **Lyrics** using section tags such as `[Verse]` and `[Chorus]`.\n3. Choose a planning **Mode**.\n4. Set the **Max Duration**.\n5. Run the workflow to generate the song.\n\n## Writing the Style\n\nDescribe the main musical characteristics, such as:\n\n- **Genre:** pop, jazz, rock, electronic, folk\n- **Vocals:** warm female vocal, expressive male vocal, soft vocals\n- **Language:** English, Chinese, Japanese, etc.\n- **Tempo:** 90 BPM, slow, upbeat\n- **Instruments:** piano, electric guitar, bass, drums, synths\n\nExample:\n\n> English, warm female vocal, contemporary pop, 96 BPM, piano, rounded electric bass, restrained drums, clear diction\n\nKeep musical instructions in **Style** rather than in the lyrics.\n\n## Writing Lyrics\n\nUse section tags to describe the song structure:\n\n    [Verse]\n    Morning light across the window\n    City waking down below\n\n    [Chorus]\n    Run with me into the sunlight\n    Leave the shadows far behind\n\nYou can structure the song with sections such as:\n\n`[Verse]` · `[Chorus]` · `[Bridge]` · `[Outro]`\n\nPut only the words intended to be sung in the lyrics field.\n\n## ABC Planning\n\n**Full**\nCreates a symbolic plan with **melody and chords** before generating the song. Recommended for general text-to-music generation.\n\n**Melody**\nCreates a **melody-only** plan and allows the accompaniment to be generated more freely.\n\nDisable **ABC Planning** to generate music directly from Style and Lyrics without creating a symbolic plan.\n\n## Max Duration\n\nSets the **maximum** duration of the generated song in seconds.\n\nThe song may finish earlier depending on the generated musical structure and lyrics.\n\n## Prompt Guide\n\nFor better results, describe the musical intent clearly and keep Style and Lyrics separate:\n\n**Style**\n`Language + Genre + Vocal Character + Tempo + Instruments + Musical Characteristics`\n\n**Lyrics**\nUse section tags and provide only the words that should be sung.\n\n## Learn More\n\n- [YuE2 Generation Guide](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/docs/generation.md)\n- [YuE2 Music Skill](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/SKILL.md)\n- [Generation & Covers Reference](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/references/generation-and-covers.md)\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "About: YuE2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [500, 1550.640625], "pos": [84.497314453125, -240.30303955078125], "id": 40, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [238.4100799560547, 122], "pos": [4434.14599609375, 77.91194152832031], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 90, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 49, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [113], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["[Verse 1]\n第一章写在北方冬天的车站\n你把蓝色围巾递给我保管\n那时我们相信地图上的每一站\n都能把未来带到眼前\n\n[Verse 2]\n第二章发生在南方的夏夜\n海风吹乱了我们写好的计划\n你说只要灯还亮着\n就不算真正走散\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我们把名字写进不同城市\n把照片放进不同抽屉\n但每一次列车经过\n我都听见同一个问题\n\n[Chorus]\n你现在在哪里\n是否也看见同一场雨\n我穿过人群和漫长的夜\n只为了确认那句约定还在原地\n你现在在哪里\n如果时间允许\n请把没有说完的故事\n留在下一次相遇\n\n[Verse 3]\n第三章没有电影里的结局\n只有一封没有寄出的信\n我学会在安静的房间里\n听自己的脚步和呼吸\n\n[Bridge]\n也许我们不必回到从前\n也许答案本来就不在终点\n如果旧地图终于被风吹远\n至少我记得你曾经出现\n\n[Final Chorus]\n你现在在哪里\n我终于不再追问天气\n穿过人群和漫长的夜\n我把曾经的遗憾唱成新的勇气\n你现在在哪里\n当最后一盏灯熄灭\n我会带着这首歌继续前进\n直到清晨重新照亮大地"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "歌词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [429.330078125, 562.71142578125], "pos": [3488.946044921875, 147.96954345703125], "id": 59, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [112], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Mandarin cinematic pop ballad, slow 76 BPM feeling, C major moving briefly to A minor in the bridge, one consistent female lead vocalist throughout the entire song, intimate close vocal in verses, layered harmonies in choruses, acoustic piano, soft strings, subtle ambient guitar, restrained drums entering after the first chorus, clear diction, stable vocal identity, emotional but not melodramatic, coherent arrangement from beginning to end."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "风格", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [420, 215.4226531982422], "pos": [3488.946044921875, -144.40963745117188], "id": 58, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [96], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [330, 270], "pos": [4731.67919921875, -224.18959045410156], "widgets_values": [456391442366811, "randomize", 32, 1, "dpm_2", "sgm_uniform", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 91, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 92, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "正面条件"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 93, "label": "负面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "负面条件"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 94, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "随机种"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "步数"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "CFG"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "采样器"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "调度器"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "降噪"}], "flags": {}, "id": 50, "type": "KSampler", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.35.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_conne